---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Notice from '../components/Notice.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
import { contact, site } from '../lib/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Terms"
  description="The terms on which the TRL website is provided and how engagement terms are agreed."
  noindex
>
  <PageIntro
    eyebrow="Legal"
    heading="Terms"
    lead="This page describes how the site and engagements work today. It has not been reviewed by a lawyer and is not yet a finalised set of terms."
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container container--reading legal stack-6">
      <Notice tone="warning" heading="Draft — pending legal review">
        <p>
          The text below is a truthful description of current practice. It is published
          as a draft and will be replaced with reviewed terms before the site is
          promoted publicly. Status: draft. Effective date: not yet set.
        </p>
      </Notice>

      <h2>About this site</h2>
      <p>
        This website is published by {site.legalName} ({site.name}). Its content
        describes services we offer and is provided for information. It is not
        professional legal, financial, tax, or employment advice.
      </p>

      <h2>Accuracy of content</h2>
      <p>
        We aim to keep descriptions and prices accurate and current. Prices shown on the
        offers page apply to the engagements described there; anything outside them is
        quoted individually. We may update content and prices, and the version you agree
        in writing is the one that applies to your engagement.
      </p>

      <h2>No contract from the website alone</h2>
      <p>
        Nothing on this site is an offer capable of acceptance. An engagement begins only
        when we agree a written scope with you and you confirm it. That written scope,
        together with the deliverables, inclusions, and exclusions stated in it, governs
        the work.
      </p>

      <h2>Enquiries</h2>
      <p>
        Please do not send confidential material or credentials in a first enquiry. We do
        not publish a guaranteed response time.
      </p>

      <h2>Third-party tools and costs</h2>
      <p>
        Engagements often use third-party software and services. Those are provided under
        their own terms and billed by those providers directly to you unless a written
        scope says otherwise.
      </p>

      <h2>Intellectual property</h2>
      <p>
        The content of this site belongs to {site.legalName}. Ownership of work produced
        in an engagement is set out in the written scope for that engagement.
      </p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>
        Questions about these terms go to
        <a href={`mailto:${contact.email}`}>{contact.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal h2 {
    margin-block-start: var(--space-8);
    font-size: var(--text-h3);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
  }
</style>
